Output docs/gifs/17-offline-playground.gif
Output docs/gifs/mp4/17-offline-playground.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1400
Set Height 860
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type `export PS1='$ '; alias sap-ai-dev='node src/launcher.mjs'; alias sap-ai-webgui='node src/webgui-server.mjs'; clear` Enter
Show
Type "node docs/gifs/source/mcp-tour.mjs demo" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 16s
